<title>MEXICO: Mexico stocks end at unofficial record.</title>
<headline>Mexico stocks end at unofficial record.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican stocks ended sharply above previous record levels at the close on Monday.</p>
<p>Dealers and analysts said light bargain-hunting to juggle portfolios swayed a thin-volume market.</p>
<p>Preliminary closing prices showed the leading IPC share index  .MXX was up 62.66 points when the closing bell rang, or 1.24 percent, at a historic level of 5,129.69.</p>
<p>(( --Martin Roberts, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
